      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/d6d6ee/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-06-23T00:39:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There's a flaw (I think) in the SotM Videogame. When I am running Unity, and I have a bunch of Platform and Raptor bots out, the game chooses FOR ME the order in which they deal damage - and this has caused me issues in games, since Raptors and Platforms do different amounts of damage, and the order in which you take down various baddies can matter a lot. Ultimately I would like to choose which bots fire first, second, etc.</p><p>Make sense?</p><p>Is this to be fixed, new information, or (hopefully not) working as intended?</p><p>Thanks.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:47:42.053Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
