      "raw": "<p>There&#39;s a flaw (I think) in the SotM Videogame. When I am running Unity, and I have a bunch of Platform and Raptor bots out, the game chooses FOR ME the order in which they deal damage - and this has caused me issues in games, since Raptors and Platforms do different amounts of damage, and the order in which you take down various baddies can matter a lot. Ultimately I would like to choose which bots fire first, second, etc.</p><p>Make sense?</p><p>Is this to be fixed, new information, or (hopefully not) working as intended?</p><p>Thanks.</p>",
